async function derive<T>(fn:(h:(v:unknown)=>string)=>T):Promise<T>{const cache=new Map<string,string>();class Missing{constructor(readonly text:string){}}for(let i=0;i<20;i++){try{return fn(v=>{const s=m77CanonicalJson(v),h=cache.get(s);if(!h)throw new Missing(s);return h})}catch(e){if(!(e instanceof Missing))throw e;cache.set(e.text,await coverageSha256(e.text))}}return fail()}
